<%- include('partials/header', { basePath: basePath }) %>

<main>
    <section class="home-hero panel">
        <div class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> CYBERSECURITY · BLUE TEAM · DEVOPS</div>
        <h1>Security is strongest<br>when <span class="text-accent">the whole system</span><br>makes sense.</h1>
        <p class="lead">I'm Khang. I completed the Information Assurance program at FPT University in 2026 and am building practical experience in security monitoring, incident analysis, and application security. This is where I share what I learn while working across security and infrastructure.</p>
        <div class="button-row"><a class="button button-primary" href="<%= basePath %>/about">More about me <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><a class="button button-secondary" href="https://github.com/khanchannn" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a></div>
        <div class="hero-note"><span class="hero-note-line"></span><span>Hands-on labs, honest lessons, and notes from the work behind the tools.</span></div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section home-focus">
        <div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">AREAS I'M GROWING IN</div><h2>Curious about how systems fail — and how to make them safer.</h2></div></div>
        <div class="focus-grid compact-focus">
            <article class="focus-card"><span class="card-index">01</span><h3>Security operations</h3><p>Monitoring, alert review, incident analysis, and automation with Wazuh and n8n.</p></article>
            <article class="focus-card"><span class="card-index">02</span><h3>Application security</h3><p>Web/API testing, OWASP concepts, practical hardening, and security-aware development.</p></article>
            <article class="focus-card"><span class="card-index">03</span><h3>Infrastructure & DevOps</h3><p>Linux, networking, containers, and AWS CI/CD and monitoring labs.</p></article>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section latest-section">
        <div class="section-heading section-heading-row"><div><div class="eyebrow">FROM MY NOTEBOOK</div><h2>Latest writing</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="<%= basePath %>/search.html">Search all posts ↗</a></div>
        <ul class="post-list"><%_ posts.forEach(post=> { _%><li class="post-item">
            <time class="post-date" datetime="<%= post.date %>"><%= post.date %></time>
            <div class="post-title"><a href="<%= basePath %>/post/<%= post.slug %>"><%= post.title %></a><% if (post.tags && post.tags.length) { %><div class="post-tags"><% post.tags.slice(0, 3).forEach(tag=> { %><span><%= tag %></span><% }) %></div><% } %></div>
            <span class="post-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </li><%_ }); if (posts.length===0) { _%><li class="empty-state">No posts found.</li><% } _%></ul>
    </section>
</main>

<%- include('partials/footer') -%>
